Converted collection / auth.secret_access_key [opencollection.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `aws_secret_access_key`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth / request.auth.secret_access_key [Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_secret_access_key`, not in the file
Converted Own Auth / request.auth.session_token [Own Auth.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `own_auth_session_token`, not in the file
Converted collection [opencollection.yml]: runs use the environment `Environment` by default, since it holds the imported credentials
Converted imported credentials [environments/Environment.yml]: the imported credentials are the secret variables `aws_secret_access_key`, `own_auth_secret_access_key`, `own_auth_session_token`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file
NeedsInput collection [-]: needs a value: `token`; nothing imported defines it, so add it to the collection's variables or an environment before sending
== Own Auth.yml
info:
  name: Own Auth
  type: http
  seq: 2

http:
  method: GET
  url: http://localhost:3000/health
  auth:
    type: awsv4
    accessKeyId: newAccessKey
    secretAccessKey: "{{own_auth_secret_access_key}}"
    sessionToken: "{{own_auth_session_token}}"
    service: service_name
    region: us-east1
    profileName: ""

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
== environments/Environment.yml
name: Environment
variables:
  - secret: true
    name: aws_secret_access_key
  - secret: true
    name: own_auth_secret_access_key
  - secret: true
    name: own_auth_session_token
== opencollection.yml
opencollection: 1.0.0

info:
  name: AWS

request:
  auth:
    type: awsv4
    accessKeyId: accessKey
    secretAccessKey: "{{aws_secret_access_key}}"
    sessionToken: "{{token}}"
    service: serviceName
    region: us-west-1
    profileName: ""
bundled: false
extensions:
  bruno:
    ignore:
      - node_modules
      - .git
    presets:
      defaultEnvironment: Environment
